#: accounts.cpp:85 modems.cpp:86
msgid ""
"Create a new dialup connection\n"
"to the Internet"
msgstr ""
"इन्टरनेटमा नयाँ डायलअप जडान\n"
"सिर्जना गर्नुहोस्"

#: accounts.cpp:88 modems.cpp:89
msgid "Co&py"
msgstr "प्रतिलिपि बनाउनुहोस्"

#: accounts.cpp:92 modems.cpp:93
msgid ""
"Makes a copy of the selected account. All\n"
"settings of the selected account are copied\n"
"to a new account that you can modify to fit your\n"
"needs"
msgstr ""
"चयन गरिएको खाताको प्रतिलिपि बनाउँदछ ।\n"
"चयन गरिएको खाताका सबै सेटिङ तपाईँले आफ्नो आवश्यकता अनुसार\n"
"मिलाउन सक्ने नयाँ खातामा\n"
"प्रतिलिपि गर्न सक्नुहुन्छ ।"

#: accounts.cpp:97 modems.cpp:98
msgid "De&lete"
msgstr "मेट्नुहोस्"

#: accounts.cpp:101 modems.cpp:102
msgid ""
"<p>Deletes the selected account\n"
"\n"
"<font color=\"red\"><b>Use with care!</b></font>"
msgstr ""
"<p>चयन गरिएको खाता मेट्दछ\n"
"\n"
"<font color=\"red\"><b>सावधानी पूर्वक प्रयोग गर्नुहोस्!</b></font>"

#: accounts.cpp:111
msgid "Phone costs:"
msgstr "फोनको खर्च:"

#: accounts.cpp:121
msgid ""
"<p>This shows the accumulated phone costs\n"
"for the selected account.\n"
"\n"
"<b>Important</b>: If you have more than one \n"
"account - beware, this is <b>NOT</b> the sum \n"
"of the phone costs of all your accounts!"
msgstr ""
"<p>यसले चयन गरेको खाताका लागि\n"
"एकिकृत फोन खर्च देखाउँछ ।\n"
"\n"
"<b>महत्वपूर्ण</b>: यदि तपाईँसँग एउटा भन्दा बढी\n"
"खाता छ भने - सावधान रहनुहोस्, यो तपाईँको <b>सबै खाताको</b> फोन खर्चको \n"
"जोड होइन!"

#: accounts.cpp:130 conwindow.cpp:52
msgid "Volume:"
msgstr "भोल्युम:"

#: accounts.cpp:139
msgid ""
"<p>This shows the number of bytes transferred\n"
"for the selected account (not for all of your\n"
"accounts. You can select what to display in\n"
"the accounting dialog.\n"
"\n"
"<a href=\"#volaccounting\">More on volume accounting</a>"
msgstr ""
"<p>यसले चयन गरिएको खाताका लागि स्थानान्तरण गरेको\n"
"बाइटको सङ्ख्या देखाउँछ (तपाईँको सबै खाताका लागि\n"
"होइन । खाता संवादमा के प्रदर्शन गर्ने\n"
"तपाईँ चयन गर्न सक्नुहुन्छ ।\n"
"\n"
"<a href=\"#volaccounting\">भोल्युम खातामा धेरै</a>"

