"The application-specific config file could not be opened in either "
"read-write or read-only mode.\n"
"The superuser might have to change its ownership by issuing the following "
"command in your home directory:\n"
"chown {YourUsername} .kde/share/config/kppprc"
msgstr ""
"अनुप्रयोग-निर्दिष्ट कन्फिग फाइल या त पढ्ने-लेख्ने वा पढ्ने-मात्र मोडमा खुल्न सकेन ।\n"
"सुपरयुजरले तपाईँको गृह डाइरेक्टरीमा निम्न आदेश लेखेर आफ्नो स्वामित्व परिवर्तन गर्न सक्छ:\n"
